zard of Oz: A Dramatic Composition (1902)</a><br/>\\r\\r\\n<a href=\\\"02.htm\\\">2. The Marvelous Land of Oz (1904)</a><br/>\\r\\r\\n<a href=\\\"03.htm\\\">3. Ozma of Oz (1907)</a><br/>\\r\\r\\n<a href=\\\"04.htm\\\">4. Dorothy and the Wizard in Oz (1908)</a><br/>\\r\\r\\n<a href=\\\"05.htm\\\">5. The Road to Oz (1909)</a><br/>\\r\\r\\n<a href=\\\"06.htm\\\">6. The Emerald City of Oz (1910)</a><br/>\\r\\r\\n<a href=\\\"07.htm\\\">7. The Patchwork Girl of Oz (1913)</a><br/>\\r\\r\\n<a href=\\\"08.htm\\\">Little Wizard Stories of Oz (1913)</a><br/>\\r\\r\\n<a href=\\\"09.htm\\\">8. Tik-Tok of Oz (1914)</a><br/>\\r\\r\\n<a href=\\\"10.htm\\\">9. The Scarecrow of Oz (1915)</a><br/>\\r\\r\\n<a href=\\\"11.htm\\\">10. Rinkitink in Oz (1916)</a><br/>\\r\\r\\n<a href=\\\"12.htm\\\">11. The Lost Princess of Oz (1917)</a><br/>\\r\\r\\n<a href=\\\"13.htm\\\">12. The Tin Woodman of Oz (1918)</a><br/>\\r\\r\\n<a href=\\\"14.htm\\\">13. The Magic of Oz (1919)</a><br/>\\r\\r\\n<a href=\\\"15.htm\\\">14. Glinda of Oz (1920)</a><br/>\\r\\r\\n</div>\\r\\r\\n</div>\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n  <div>\\r\\r\\n    <input type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"cx\\\" value=\\\"002807121847390519013:ddj9f84mdsw\\\" />\\r\\r\\n    <input type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"ie\\\" value=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\r\\r\\n    <input type=\\\"text\\\" name=\\\"q\\\" size=\\\"31\\\" />\\r\\r\\n    <input type=\\\"submit\\\" name=\\\"sa\\\" value=\\\"Search\\\" />\\r\\r\\n  </div>\\r\\r\\n<script type=\\\"text/javascript\\\" src=\\\"https://www.google.com/coop/cse/brand?form=cse-search-box&lang=en\\\"></script>\\r\\r\\n        </body>\\r\\r\\n</html>\\r\\r\\n\\nUser suggestion: \\n\"}],\"plugins\":[{\"id\":\"response-healing\"}],\"tools\":[{\"type\":\"openrouter:web_fetch\",\"parameters\":{\"max_content_tokens\":100000}}],\"response_format\":{\"type\":\"json_schema\",\"json_schema\":{\"name\":\"webpages_improver_response\",\"description\":\"Complete improved HTML\",\"strict\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"