\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\thasAdvancedOptions=false;\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\telse\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t{\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\thasAdvancedOptions=false;\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\tcatch(e){\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tif (e.name.toString() == 'ReferenceError' ){\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\thasAdvancedOptions=false;\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\tif(hasAdvancedOptions){\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tid=target.data().relHookdataId;\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tcontent_type=\\\"product_group\\\"\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\telse{\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tid=sku;\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tcontent_type=\\\"product\\\"\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\tif(pos==0){\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tids=\\\"'\\\"+id+\\\"'\\\";\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tcurrency = target.data().relHookdataCurrency;\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\telse{\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tids=ids+\\\",\\\"+\\\"'\\\"+id+\\\"'\\\";\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\tvar price = target.data().relHookdataPrice;\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\ttotal+=parseFloat(price);\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\tpos = pos + 1;\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n});\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\ntotal = total.toFixed(2);\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\nif(ids!=\\\"\\\"){\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\tids = \\\"[\\\"+ids+\\\"]\\\";\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\tfbq('track', 'ViewContent', {\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\tcontent_ids: ids,\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\tcontent_type: content_type,\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\tvalue: total,\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\tcurrency: currency\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t});\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n</script>\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n<noscript>\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n<img height='1' width='1' style='display:none' src='https://www.facebook.com/tr?id=731885793537364&ev=ViewContent&noscript=1' />\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n</noscript>\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</body>\\n</html>\", \"improvements\": [{\"What\": \"Rewrote the top announcement banner to lead with 'FREE Shipping on Orders $99+' alongside the sale link.\", \"Why\": \"Free shipping thresholds are one of the strongest conversion drivers; the $99 threshold already exists in the site's commented-out JS but was never surfaced to shoppers. Making it visible increases both conversion rate and average order value.\", \"Hash\": \"a1f3c9d2\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a persistent USP/trust bar below the main navigation with Free Shipping Over $99, Easy Returns, Trusted Since 1999, and Wholesale Prices.\", \"Why\": \"Trust signals and value propositions visible above the fold reduce purchase anxiety and are proven to lift conversion, especially for first-time visitors.\", \"Hash\": \"b7e2d410\"}, {\"What\": \"Fixed the first hero carousel slide which had an empty href, and repaired the malformed style=\\\"tabindex=\\\"-1\\\" attributes on all slides.\", \"Why\": \"The primary hero banner (double rewards points) was completely unclickable — a dead click on the most prominent element of the page. It now links to /rewards-program. Malformed attributes also risked rendering/accessibility problems.\", \"Hash\": \"c58f1e77\"}, {\"What\": \"Replaced generic 'Sale' badges with specific savings percentages (Save 15%, Save 34%, Save 50%, Save 60%) on discounted featured products.\", \"Why\": \"Quantified savings communicate deal value far more effectively than a generic 'Sale' label and increase click-through and add-to-cart rates.\", \"Hash\": \"d94ab3c1\"}, {\"What\": \"Changed the out-of-stock 'Extra Long and Wide Yoga Mat' CTA from an add-to-cart link to a 'Notify Me When Available' link pointing to the product page.\", \"Why\": \"Sending users to an add-to-cart flow for an out-of-stock item creates a frustrating dead end; a back-in-stock path captures demand instead of losing it.\", \"Hash\": \"e6c07f28\"}, {\"What\": \"Renamed 'Featured Products' to 'Best-Selling Yoga Gear' with a social-proof subheading, and added a prominent 'Shop All Deals' CTA button after the product grid.\", \"Why\": \"Best-seller framing leverages social proof, and a clear next-step CTA at the end of the grid keeps shoppers moving deeper into the funnel instead of stalling.\", \"Hash\": \"f1b8a562\"}, {\"What\": \"Added JSON-LD structured data (Organization + WebSite with SearchAction) and a visually hidden H1 heading.\", \"Why\": \"The homepage had no H1 and no structured data. These improve SEO rankings, enable a sitelinks search box in Google, and drive more qualified organic traffic (revenue at zero acquisition cost).\", \"Hash\": \"0a9d4e83\"}, {\"What\": \"Fixed the corrupted meta keywords encoding (\\ffd characters), improved image alt texts throughout (hero slides, category banners, logo), and made the search placeholder more descriptive ('Search mats, props & more').\", \"Why\": \"Clean metadata and descriptive alt text improve SEO and accessibility; a guiding search placeholder increases search engagement, and searchers convert at significantly higher rates.\", \"Hash\": \"13c6b0f4\"}, {\"What\": \"Added preconnect hints for critical third-party origins, display=swap to Google Font requests, and loading=\\\"lazy\\\" to below-the-fold images.\", \"Why\": \"Faster perceived load time directly correlates with lower bounce rates and higher conversion; every 100ms of speed improvement measurably lifts revenue.\", \"Hash\": \"2e75d1a9\"}, {\"What\": \"Fixed the invalid nested anchor tags in the mobile menu contact block and added rel=\\\"noopener\\\" to all target=\\\"_blank\\\" links; added a descriptive title to the quick-view iframe and a 'Get a Quote' button to the custom printing banner plus a 'Learn Why Studios Choose Us' CTA in the brand story section.\", \"Why\": \"The broken nested anchors could render unpredictably on mobile (a large traffic segment); rel=noopener improves security. Explicit CTA buttons on banner and story sections convert passive readers into engaged B2B and B2C leads.\", \"Hash\": \"3f82c7b5\"}, {\"What\": \"Highlighted the 'Deals' navigation item in red bold styling.\", \"Why\": \"Visually differentiating the deals link draws bargain-hunting traffic into high-intent discounted inventory, increasing engagement and conversion from the main nav.\", \"Hash\": \"4d1e9a06\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"I'm planning conversion rate optimization fixes for this HTML: correcting the broken title/meta encoding, adding an urgency-driven free shipping banner, fixing the empty hero link to point somewhere useful like /deals, and layering in trust signals throughout the page.\n\nI'll also add a value proposition bar highlighting shipping thresholds and easy returns, fix malformed HTML attributes and missing hrefs, add preconnect hints and structured data for SEO, and make sure the page has a proper H1 for accessibility and search visibility.\n\nI should improve the search placeholder text, refine alt text on carousel images for consistency, and consider a newsletter signup incentive — though without a working form endpoint, I'll likely skip that and instead promote the rewards program elsewhere. I'll leave the duplicate GA tag as low-risk and focus on smaller polish items like sticky free-returns microcopy and consistent messaging titles.\n\nI'm also planning to add schema.org JSON-LD for WebSite/SearchAction and Organization data, build a value-prop icon bar (free shipping over $99, easy returns, 20+ years trusted, wholesale pricing), rename \"Featured Products\" to something punchier like \"Best-Selling Yoga Gear,\" and update the top banner copy to mention the $99 free-shipping threshold pulled from the commented JS. For the out-of-stock item I'll swap its CTA to \"View Details,\" and I still need to fix a nested anchor bug in the mobile menu markup where a phone link is improperly wrapped.\n\nWriting the value-prop bar HTML...\n\nI'll place this section right after the navbar wrapper and before the content holder, then add JSON-LD structured data for the website with its name and URL.\n\nI'm rounding out the schema markup with the search action and adding Organization schema with phone details. For accessibility, I'll add a visually hidden h1 in the home section using the existing \"sronly\" class, and update the \"Featured Products\" header to something more descriptive like \"Shop Our Best-Selling Yoga Gear\" while keeping its styling class. I also need to fix a malformed carousel list item attribute, correct an empty first-slide link to point to the rewards program page, and improve the alt text throughout.\n\nI'm also fixing the meta keywords by replacing stray characters with spaces, adding lazy loading to product and footer thumbnails, and deciding to keep the newsletter section minimal rather than building out a full email capture form. For the out-of-stock extended mat item, I'm changing its button to link to the product page with \"View Details\" text instead of an add-to-cart action.\n\nI need to fix a nested anchor issue in the mobile phone/mail links, add rel=\"noopener\" to external target=\"_blank\" links, and update the shipping banner text to promote free shipping on $99+ orders with a link to discounted gear. I'll use short hex strings as identifiers for the requested \"Hash\" field, then carefully reassemble the full HTML with all these changes applied, outputting it as a single-line JSON string with escaped newlines.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm planning conversion rate optimization fixes for this HTML: correcting the broken title/meta encoding, adding an urgency-driven free shipping banner, fixing the empty hero link to point somewhere useful like /deals, and layering in trust signals throughout the page.\n\nI'll also add a value proposition bar highlighting shipping thresholds and easy returns, fix malformed HTML attributes and missing hrefs, add preconnect hints and structured data for SEO, and make sure the page has a proper H1 for accessibility and search visibility.\n\nI should improve the search placeholder text, refine alt text on carousel images for consistency, and consider a newsletter signup incentive — though without a working form endpoint, I'll likely skip that and instead promote the rewards program elsewhere. I'll leave the duplicate GA tag as low-risk and focus on smaller polish items like sticky free-returns microcopy and consistent messaging titles.\n\nI'm also planning to add schema.org JSON-LD for WebSite/SearchAction and Organization data, build a value-prop icon bar (free shipping over $99, easy returns, 20+ years trusted, wholesale pricing), rename \"Featured Products\" to something punchier like \"Best-Selling Yoga Gear,\" and update the top banner copy to mention the $99 free-shipping threshold pulled from the commented JS. For the out-of-stock item I'll swap its CTA to \"View Details,\" and I still need to fix a nested anchor bug in the mobile menu markup where a phone link is improperly wrapped.\n\nWriting the value-prop bar HTML...\n\nI'll place this section right after the navbar wrapper and before the content holder, then add JSON-LD structured data for the website with its name and URL.\n\nI'm rounding out the schema markup with the search action and adding Organization schema with phone details. For accessibility, I'll add a visually hidden h1 in the home section using the existing \"sronly\" class, and update the \"Featured Products\" header to something more descriptive like \"Shop Our Best-Selling Yoga Gear\" while keeping its styling class. I also need to fix a malformed carousel list item attribute, correct an empty first-slide link to point to the rewards program page, and improve the alt text throughout.\n\nI'm also fixing the meta keywords by replacing stray characters with spaces, adding lazy loading to product and footer thumbnails, and deciding to keep the newsletter section minimal rather than building out a full email capture form. For the out-of-stock extended mat item, I'm changing its button to link to the product page with \"View Details\" text instead of an add-to-cart action.\n\nI need to fix a nested anchor issue in the mobile phone/mail links, add rel=\"noopener\" to external target=\"_blank\" links, and update the shipping banner text to promote free shipping on $99+ orders with a link to discounted gear. I'll use short hex strings as identifiers for the requested \"Hash\" field, then carefully reassemble the full HTML with all these changes applied, outputting it as a single-line JSON string with escaped newlines.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":""}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":33956,"completion_tokens":46893,"total_tokens":80849,"cost":2.68421,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":2.68421,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.33956,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":2.34465},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":2510,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}
