nce 2002'), and a clickable phone number.\", \"Why\": \"Trust signals near the top of a discount page reduce purchase anxiety (a common blocker on 'too good to be true' sale pricing) and the visible phone number provides an assisted-sales path for hesitant buyers.\", \"Hash\": \"trust-strip-04\"}, {\"What\": \"Changed the products count heading from 'Products [21]' to '21 Deals — While Supplies Last'.\", \"Why\": \"Reframes the inventory count as a limited set of deals, reinforcing scarcity and encouraging shoppers to browse and buy now instead of leaving to compare.\", \"Hash\": \"count-urgency-05\"}, {\"What\": \"Improved the page title tag to 'Yoga Gear Sale — Up to 65% Off Mats, Props & More | YogaDirect' and rewrote the meta description to lead with the discount and urgency.\", \"Why\": \"Discount-led titles and descriptions improve organic and paid click-through rates, bringing more qualified deal-seeking traffic to the page at no extra cost.\", \"Hash\": \"seo-title-meta-06\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a category footer cross-sell block linking to Yoga Kits & Bundles, the Rewards Program, and the phone line, and added descriptive alt text to the sale banner image.\", \"Why\": \"Shoppers who reach the bottom without buying get a next-step path to higher-AOV bundles and loyalty enrollment instead of exiting; the alt text also improves accessibility and image SEO.\", \"Hash\": \"footer-crosssell-07\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"I'm thinking through conversion improvements for this yoga sale page—adding urgency messaging, fixing the shipping banner to reflect it's the actual sale page, adding savings percentage badges, and strengthening the heading with a clearer value proposition.\n\nI'm calculating actual discount percentages across items to pick an honest \"up to X% off\" claim, landing around 65-68% based on the biggest markdowns, and planning per-item \"Save X%\" badges to replace generic \"Sale\" labels.\n\nFinishing my scan of discount percentages across the