ReferenceError' ){\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\thasAdvancedOptions=false;\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\tif(hasAdvancedOptions){\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tid=target.data().relHookdataId;\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tcontent_type=\\\"product_group\\\"\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\telse{\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tid=sku;\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tcontent_type=\\\"product\\\"\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\tif(pos==0){\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tids=\\\"'\\\"+id+\\\"'\\\";\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tcurrency = target.data().relHookdataCurrency;\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\telse{\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tids=ids+\\\",\\\"+\\\"'\\\"+id+\\\"'\\\";\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\tvar price = target.data().relHookdataPrice;\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\ttotal+=parseFloat(price);\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\tpos = pos + 1;\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n});\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\ntotal = total.toFixed(2);\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\nif(ids!=\\\"\\\"){\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\tids = \\\"[\\\"+ids+\\\"]\\\";\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\tfbq('track', 'ViewContent', {\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\tcontent_ids: ids,\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\tcontent_type: content_type,\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\tvalue: total,\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\tcurrency: currency\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t});\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n}\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n</script>\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n<noscript>\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n<img height='1' width='1' style='display:none' src='https://www.facebook.com/tr?id=731885793537364&ev=ViewContent&noscript=1' />\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n</noscript>\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</body>\\n</html>\", \"improvements\": [{\"What\": \"Rewrote the page title to 'Classic Yoga Mats from $16.99 | Durable, Non-Slip & Affordable | YogaDirect' and updated the meta description with price anchoring, key benefits, and the free shipping offer.\", \"Why\": \"Keyword-rich titles with price anchors and benefit-driven meta descriptions improve organic click-through rates, bringing more qualified traffic that is primed to convert.\", \"Hash\": \"a1f3c9d2\"}, {\"What\": \"Replaced the vague top banner text ('Shop Discounted Yoga Gear >>>>') with a prominent 'FREE Shipping on Orders $99+' message alongside the sale link.\", \"Why\": \"Free shipping thresholds are one of the strongest conversion levers; surfacing the $99 threshold (already referenced in the site's own scripts) encourages larger cart sizes and reduces shipping-cost anxiety.\", \"Hash\": \"b7e2d410\"}, {\"What\": \"Upgraded the H1 from 'Classic' to 'Classic Yoga Mats' and added a short benefit-focused intro paragraph with a $16.99 price anchor and a link to quantity/studio pricing.\", \"Why\": \"A descriptive H1 improves SEO relevance, while intro copy frames value ('durability without the premium price') and routes bulk buyers (studios/schools) to higher-AOV quantity pricing.\", \"Hash\": \"c4d81e77\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a trust bar directly under the category header showing Free Shipping Over $99, Easy Returns, a clickable expert phone line, and Secure Checkout.\", \"Why\": \"Trust signals placed near the point of decision reduce purchase hesitation and cart abandonment, particularly for first-time visitors landing on category pages from search or ads.\", \"Hash\": \"d9a05b3e\"}, {\"What\": \"Changed the generic 'Sale' badge on the 1/4 Inch Yoga Mat to 'Save 15%'.\", \"Why\": \"Quantified savings ('Save 15%') are more persuasive than a generic 'Sale' label and increase click-through from listing to product page.\", \"Hash\": \"e6f74a21\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a 'TOP RATED' badge to the Extra Wide Yoga Mat, which has a perfect 5-star rating.\", \"Why\": \"Social proof badges draw attention to best-reviewed in-stock products, guiding undecided shoppers toward items with the highest purchase confidence.\", \"Hash\": \"f2b39c58\"}, {\"What\": \"Reordered the product grid so the two out-of-stock items (Extra Long & Wide Mat, Hanging Mat) appear last, after all in-stock products.\", \"Why\": \"Leading with purchasable products reduces friction and dead-end clicks; showing out-of-stock items first wastes prime grid positions and depresses conversion.\", \"Hash\": \"0c8d17ab\"}, {\"What\": \"Changed the CTA on out-of-stock products from 'Select Options' (add-to-cart link) to 'Notify Me' linking directly to the product page.\", \"Why\": \"'Select Options' on unavailable items creates a frustrating dead end; 'Notify Me' sets correct expectations and captures demand for restock, recovering otherwise lost sales.\", \"Hash\": \"1e5f62cd\"}, {\"What\": \"Changed in-stock product CTAs from 'Select Options' to the more action-oriented 'Shop Now'.\", \"Why\": \"Action-oriented CTAs outperform process-descriptive labels; 'Shop Now' invites engagement rather than signaling extra configuration work ahead.\", \"Hash\": \"27a9e044\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a cross-sell section below the product grid linking to Premium Mats, Yoga Kits & Bundles, and the phone line for expert help.\", \"Why\": \"Shoppers who don't find a fit among 6 classic mats need a next step; guided cross-links to higher-margin premium mats and bundles increase revenue per visitor and reduce bounce.\", \"Hash\": \"38c1f592\"}, {\"What\": \"Added ItemList JSON-LD structured data listing all six products in the category.\", \"Why\": \"Structured data helps search engines understand the category listing, improving eligibility for enhanced search results and driving more qualified organic traffic.\", \"Hash\": \"49d20e6f\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"I'm thinking through conversion improvements for this category page: clearer trust and urgency cues, a benefit bar, SEO-friendly category descriptions, and refining product card CTAs like swapping \"Select Options\" for \"Shop Now\" or \"Notify Me\" on out-of-stock items, plus surfacing savings badges on sale products.\n\nI want to add trust badges (free shipping threshold, returns, phone support), tighten the meta description and title tag, add category intro copy with value messaging, and fix out-of-stock handling by changing their CTA and moving them toward the end of the listing. I'm now drafting the improved HTML with the title tag, meta description, and a free shipping banner reflecting the $99 threshold.\n\nI'm also working out the specific savings percentages for each sale item, adjusting CTA button text (like \"Shop Now\" for in-stock and \"View Details\" for out-of-stock), reordering products so out-of-stock items appear last while keeping their reviews visible, adding a trust bar and ItemList structured data, and considering a \"Top Rated\" badge for the product with strong reviews. I need to be careful preserving valid JSON and properly escaping quotes within the HTML.\n\nAdding trust bar markup...\n\nI'll place this trust bar under the page header, add a short intro paragraph under the H1 emphasizing durability and USA shipping, update sale badges to show percentage/dollar savings, and finalize the CTA button copy.\n\nFor in-stock items I'll settle on \"Shop Now\" as the button text since it's simpler than alternatives like \"Select Options\" or \"Choose Color & Buy.\" For out-of-stock items, I'll change the link to point to the product page and update the button text to \"Notify Me.\"\n\nI also want to add JSON-LD ItemList structured data for the products, along with a title and meta description that mention pricing starting at $16.99 and include a call to action. On top of that, I'm thinking of adding a small \"Top Rated\" badge overlay on one of the product images to draw attention.\n\nI'll also clean up the free shipping banner text, replacing the odd arrow characters with a proper link to the sale page. Now I'm putting together the full HTML output, preserving the original structure while weaving in these edits and the improvements list, making sure to escape everything properly for JSON.\n\nNow going through each changed segment: updating the title, meta description, adding a JSON-LD ItemList script in the head, refreshing the shipping text, adding an intro paragraph and trust bar after the page header, and adjusting product badges and CTAs for consistency across listings like \"Save 15%\" and \"Shop Now\" while keeping some as \"Sale\" where appropriate.\n\nFor the out-of-stock products moved to the end, I'm changing their CTA to \"Notify Me\" linking to the product page rather than a longer \"Out of Stock\" label, keeping the button style consistent.\n\nWriting ItemList schema JSON...\n\nNow I'm ready to write the full improved HTML output, keeping all original scripts and comments intact while reordering the two out-of-stock products (and their trailing scripts) to the end of the list. I'm also drafting the improvements list, starting with the optimized title/meta description for better CTR and a free-shipping value prop added to the banner.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm thinking through conversion improvements for this category page: clearer trust and urgency cues, a benefit bar, SEO-friendly category descriptions, and refining product card CTAs like swapping \"Select Options\" for \"Shop Now\" or \"Notify Me\" on out-of-stock items, plus surfacing savings badges on sale products.\n\nI want to add trust badges (free shipping threshold, returns, phone support), tighten the meta description and title tag, add category intro copy with value messaging, and fix out-of-stock handling by changing their CTA and moving them toward the end of the listing. I'm now drafting the improved HTML with the title tag, meta description, and a free shipping banner reflecting the $99 threshold.\n\nI'm also working out the specific savings percentages for each sale item, adjusting CTA button text (like \"Shop Now\" for in-stock and \"View Details\" for out-of-stock), reordering products so out-of-stock items appear last while keeping their reviews visible, adding a trust bar and ItemList structured data, and considering a \"Top Rated\" badge for the product with strong reviews. I need to be careful preserving valid JSON and properly escaping quotes within the HTML.\n\nAdding trust bar markup...\n\nI'll place this trust bar under the page header, add a short intro paragraph under the H1 emphasizing durability and USA shipping, update sale badges to show percentage/dollar savings, and finalize the CTA button copy.\n\nFor in-stock items I'll settle on \"Shop Now\" as the button text since it's simpler than alternatives like \"Select Options\" or \"Choose Color & Buy.\" For out-of-stock items, I'll change the link to point to the product page and update the button text to \"Notify Me.\"\n\nI also want to add JSON-LD ItemList structured data for the products, along with a title and meta description that mention pricing starting at $16.99 and include a call to action. On top of that, I'm thinking of adding a small \"Top Rated\" badge overlay on one of the product images to draw attention.\n\nI'll also clean up the free shipping banner text, replacing the odd arrow characters with a proper link to the sale page. Now I'm putting together the full HTML output, preserving the original structure while weaving in these edits and the improvements list, making sure to escape everything properly for JSON.\n\nNow going through each changed segment: updating the title, meta description, adding a JSON-LD ItemList script in the head, refreshing the shipping text, adding an intro paragraph and trust bar after the page header, and adjusting product badges and CTAs for consistency across listings like \"Save 15%\" and \"Shop Now\" while keeping some as \"Sale\" where appropriate.\n\nFor the out-of-stock products moved to the end, I'm changing their CTA to \"Notify Me\" linking to the product page rather than a longer \"Out of Stock\" label, keeping the button style consistent.\n\nWriting ItemList schema JSON...\n\nNow I'm ready to write the full improved HTML output, keeping all original scripts and comments intact while reordering the two out-of-stock products (and their trailing scripts) to the end of the list. I'm also drafting the improvements list, starting with the optimized title/meta description for better CTR and a free-shipping value prop added to the banner.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":""}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":22351,"completion_tokens":34822,"total_tokens":57173,"cost":1.96461,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,