.800.331.8233</strong></a> (Mon&ndash;Fri, 9am&ndash;5pm EST) and we&rsquo;ll help you right away.</p>\\n</div>\\n\\n<h2 class=\\\"customH2 yd-section-head\\\">Buying For A Studio, School Or Team?</h2>\\n<p class=\\\"yd-section-sub\\\">We supply yoga studios, schools, gyms, therapists and corporate wellness programs &mdash; with volume pricing and custom logo printing.</p>\\n<div class=\\\"yd-shop-band\\\">\\n  <p style=\\\"margin-bottom:14px\\\">Tell us what you need and we&rsquo;ll put together a quote. Call <a href=\\\"tel:+18003318233\\\" class=\\\"blue\\\"><strong>1.800.331.8233</strong></a>, or use the options below.</p>\\n  <a class=\\\"yd-btn\\\" href=\\\"/quantity-discount-yoga-gear\\\">See Quantity Discounts</a>\\n  <a class=\\\"yd-btn yd-btn-alt\\\" href=\\\"/custom-printing\\\">Custom Logo Printing</a>\\n  <a class=\\\"yd-btn yd-btn-alt\\\" href=\\\"#send-a-message\\\">Request A Quote</a>\\n</div>\\n\\n<h2 class=\\\"customH2 yd-section-head\\\">Contact Details</h2>\\n<div class=\\\"yd-detail-row\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"yd-detail\\\">\\n    <h3>Phone</h3>\\n    <p>Toll Free: <a href=\\\"tel:+18003318233\\\" class=\\\"blue\\\">1.800.331.8233</a></p>\\n    <p>Local: <a href=\\\"tel:+18607683086\\\" class=\\\"blue\\\">1.860.768.3086</a></p>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"yd-detail\\\">\\n    <h3>Email</h3>\\n    <p>Customer Service &amp; Sales:<br><a href=\\\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#c4a7b1b7b0aba9a1b6b7a1b6b2ada7a184bdaba3a5a0adb6a1a7b0eaa7aba9\\\" class=\\\"blue\\\"><span class=\\\"__cf_email__\\\" data-cfemail=\\\"583b2d2b2c37353d2a2b3d2a2e313b3d1821373f393c312a3d3b2c763b3735\\\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p>\\n    <p>Custom Printing:<br><a href=\\\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#7f1c0a0c0b1012520f0d16110b1611183f0610181e1b160d1a1c0b511c1012\\\" class=\\\"blue\\\"><span class=\\\"__cf_email__\\\" data-cfemail=\\\"6704121413080a4a17150e09130e0900271e080006030e150204134904080a\\\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"yd-detail\\\">\\n    <h3>Hours</h3>\\n    <p>Monday &ndash; Friday</p>\\n    <p>9:00 am &ndash; 5:00 pm EST</p>\\n    <p style=\\\"color:#777;font-size:14px;margin-top:8px\\\">Messages sent after hours are answered the next business day.</p>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"yd-detail\\\">\\n    <h3>Mailing Address</h3>\\n    <p>YogaDirect</p>\\n    <p>219 Turner Road, Suite 225</p>\\n    <p>North Chesterfield, VA 23225</p>\\n    <p style=\\\"color:#a94442;font-size:13px;margin-top:8px\\\">*Please do not send returns to this address. See our <a href=\\\"/returns\\\">returns policy</a> first &mdash; extra charges may apply if return instructions are not followed.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<h2 class=\\\"customH2 yd-section-head\\\">Common Questions</h2>\\n<p class=\\\"yd-section-sub\\\">Tap a question to see the answer instantly.</p>\\n<div class=\\\"yd-faq\\\">\\n  <details>\\n    <summary>Where is my order? / Order status</summary>\\n    <div class=\\\"yd-faq-body\\\">The latest status on your order is available any time by <a href=\\\"/myaccount.asp\\\" class=\\\"blue\\\">logging in to your account</a> &mdash; all you need is your email address and password. Forgot your password? Just enter your email address and we&rsquo;ll send you a reset. If you still can&rsquo;t determine the status of your order, <a href=\\\"#send-a-message\\\" class=\\\"blue\\\">message us above</a> and include your order number, order date and/or the name on the order so we can locate it quickly.</div>\\n  </details>\\n  <details>\\n    <summary>Something is missing or damaged in my order</summary>\\n    <div class=\\\"yd-faq-body\\\">We&rsquo;ll make it right. <a href=\\\"#send-a-message\\\" class=\\\"blue\\\">Send us a message</a> with your order number, order date and/or name on the order, plus a quick description (and a photo if it&rsquo;s damaged), and we&rsquo;ll take care of it.</div>\\n  </details>\\n  <details>\\n    <summary>Returns, exchanges or cancellations</summary>\\n    <div class=\\\"yd-faq-body\\\">See our <a href=\\\"/Hassle-Free-Returns_ep_42-1.html\\\" class=\\\"blue\\\">hassle-free return policy</a> for full details and instructions before shipping anything back.</div>\\n  </details>\\n  <details>\\n    <summary>Sales questions and phone orders</summary>\\n    <div class=\\\"yd-faq-body\\\">Happy to help you order by phone. Call us toll free at <a href=\\\"tel:+18003318233\\\" class=\\\"blue\\\">1.800.331.8233</a> during business hours, or email <a href=\\\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#fa899b969f89ba83959d9b9e93889f998ed4999597\\\" class=\\\"blue\\\"><span class=\\\"__cf_email__\\\" data-cfemail=\\\"7e0d1f121b0d3e0711191f1a170c1b1d0a501d1113\\\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>.</div>\\n  </details>\\n  <details>\\n    <summary>Shipping questions</summary>\\n    <div class=\\\"yd-faq-body\\\">Rates, methods and transit times are listed on our <a href=\\\"/shipping\\\" class=\\\"blue\\\">shipping information page</a>.</div>\\n  </details>\\n</div>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"yd-shop-band\\\">\\n  <h2 class=\\\"customH2\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">While You&rsquo;re Here &mdash; Shop Popular Gear</h2>\\n  <p style=\\\"margin-bottom:14px\\\">Studio-quality mats, bolsters, blankets and props &mdash; plus kits that bundle everything you need.</p>\\n  <a class=\\\"yd-btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Shop Yoga Mats</a>\\n  <a class=\\\"yd-btn yd-btn-alt\\\" href=\\\"/bolsters\\\">Bolsters</a>\\n  <a class=\\\"yd-btn yd-btn-alt\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-props\\\">Props</a>\\n  <a class=\\\"yd-btn yd-btn-alt\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-kits\\\">Kits &amp; Bundles</a>\\n  <a class=\\\"yd-btn yd-btn-alt\\\" href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a>\\n</div>\\n\\n</div>\\n<script>\\n(function(){\\n  var chat = document.getElementById('yd-chat');\\n  function openChat(e){\\n    if (window.tidioChatApi && typeof window.tidioChatApi.open === 'function') {\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      window.tidioChatApi.open();\\n      if (typeof gtag === 'function') { gtag('event','contact_chat_open',{'event_category':'contact','event_label':'contact page chat card'}); }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (chat) { chat.addEventListener('click', openChat); }\\n  var jump = document.getElementById('yd-jump-form');\\n  if (jump) {\\n    jump.addEventListener('click', function(){\\n      var first = document.getElementById('element_0');\\n      if (first) { setTimeout(function(){ try { first.focus(); } catch(err){} }, 450); }\\n    });\\n  }\\n})();\\n</script>\\n     </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"yd-sticky\\\" aria-label=\\\"quick contact options\\\">\\n  <a href=\\\"tel:+18003318233\\\" onclick=\\\"if(typeof gtag==='function'){gtag('event','contact_call',{'event_category':'contact','event_label':'mobile sticky bar'});}\\\">&#9742; Call Us</a>\\n  <a class=\\\"alt\\\" href=\\\"#send-a-message\\\">&#9993; Email Us</a>\\n</div>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n    <!--/Get current page template-->\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- FOOTER -->\\n    \\n    <footer class=\\\"site-footer lazy\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"col-xs-12\\\">\\n                  &nbsp;\\n                    <!--START: FRAME_MAILLIST--><!--END: FRAME_MAILLIST-->\\n                </div>\\n                <div class=\\\"col-xs-12 FooterLinks\\\">\\n                  <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n                    <div class=\\\"col-xs-12 col-sm-4 col-md-2_4\\\">\\n                        <h4>Shop Yoga Gear</h4>\\n                        <ul id=\\\"extrapages\\\" class=\\\"list-unstyled extrapages\\\">\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Mats</a></li>\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/bolsters\\\">Bolsters</a></li>\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/blankets\\\">Blankets</a></li>\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-props\\\">Props</a></li>\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-fitness\\\">Fitness</a></li>\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/custom-printing\\\">Custom Printing</a></li>\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/clothing\\\">Clothing</a></li>\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/deals\\\">Deals</a></li>\\n                        </ul>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div class=\\\"col-xs-12 col-sm-4 col-md-3\\\">\\n                        <h4>COMPANY</h4>\\n                        <ul class=\\\"extrapages\\\">\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/the-direct-difference\\\">why yoga direct?</a></li>\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">shipping info</a></li>\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">returns</a></li>\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/contact-us\\\">contact us</a></li>\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/terms-and-conditions\\\">terms and conditions</a></li>\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/privacy-policy\\\">privacy policy</a></li>\\n                        </ul>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div class=\\\"col-xs-12 col-sm-4 col-md-3\\\">\\n                        <h4>CUSTOMER SERVICE</h4>\\n                        <ul class=\\\"extrapages\\\">\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"tel:+18003318233\\\">call 1.800.331.8233</a></li>\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/blog.asp\\\">blog</a></li>\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/faqs\\\">FAQs</a></li>\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/rewards-program\\\">Rewards Program</a></li>\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/quantity-discount-yoga-gear\\\">quantity discounts</a></li>\\n                          <li><a href=\\\"/ada-accessibility\\\">ADA Accessibility</a></li>\\n                        </ul>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div class=\\\"col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-3 stay-connected\\\">\\n                        \\n                        <!--START: social_icons-->\\n                        <h4> Stay Connected</h4>\\n                        <ul class=\\\"social-icons list-unstyled list-inline\\\">\\n                            <!--START: social_link_facebook-->\\n                            <li><a href=\\\"https://www.facebook.com/yogadirect/\\\" class=\\\"facebook\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" title=\\\"Like Us on Facebook\\\"><span class=\\\"icon-facebook\\\"></span></a></li>\\n                            <!--END: social_link_facebook-->\\n                            <!--START: social_link_twitter--><!--END: social_link_twitter-->\\n                            \\n                            <!--START: social_link_youTube--><!--END: social_link_youTube-->\\n                            <!--START: social_link_pinterest-->\\n                            <li><a href=\\\"https://www.pinterest.com/YogaDirect/\\\" class=\\\"pinterest\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" title=\\\"Follow Us on Pinterest\\\"><span class=\\\"icon-pinterest\\\"></span></a></li>\\n                            <!--END: social_link_pinterest-->\\n                            <!--START: social_link_instagram-->\\n                            <li><a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/theyogadirect\\\" class=\\\"instagram\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" title=\\\"Follow Us on Instagram\\\"><span class=\\\"icon-instagram\\\"></span></a></li>\\n                            <!--END: social_link_instagram-->\\n                            <!--START: social_link_tumblr--><!--END: social_link_tumblr-->\\n                            <!--START: social_link_blog-->\\n                            <li><a href=\\\"http://www.yogadirect.com/blog.asp\\\" class=\\\"blog\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" title=\\\"Subscribe to our Blog\\\"><span class=\\\"icon-rss\\\"></span></a></li>\\n                            <!--END: social_link_blog-->\\n                        </ul>\\n                        <br />\\n                        <!--END: social_icons-->\\n                        \\n                        <h4>PAYMENT METHODS</h4>\\n                        <u