\\t\\t<!--END: CATEGORY_ITEMS-->\\n\\n                    <p class=\\\"text-center\\\" style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#666;margin:6px 0 22px;\\\">Need a different amount? Buy more than one card, or <a href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\">call us at 800-331-8233</a> and we&rsquo;ll set up any value you like.</p>\\n\\n                    <ul class=\\\"gc-trust\\\">\\n                        <li>&#10003; No shipping cost &mdash; sent by email</li>\\n                        <li>&#10003; No expiration date or fees</li>\\n                        <li>&#10003; Redeemable on 1,000+ products</li>\\n                        <li>&#10003; Friendly US-based support: <a href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\">800-331-8233</a></li>\\n                    </ul>\\n\\n                    <div class=\\\"gc-bulk\\\">\\n                        <h3>Buying for a studio, team or event?</h3>\\n                        <p>Teacher appreciation, challenge prizes, corporate wellness or client gifts &mdash; we can issue gift cards in bulk and help with quantity pricing on gear.</p>\\n                        <a href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\">Call 800-331-8233</a>\\n                        <a href=\\\"/contact-us\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-default\\\">Request a bulk quote</a>\\n                        <a href=\\\"/quantity-discount-yoga-gear\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-default\\\">See quantity pricing</a>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <section class=\\\"gc-steps row text-center\\\">\\n                        <div class=\\\"col-xs-12\\\"><h2>How it works</h2></div>\\n                        <div class=\\\"col-sm-4 gc-step\\\">\\n                            <span class=\\\"num\\\">1</span>\\n                            <h4>Choose an amount</h4>\\n                            <p>$25, $50 or $100 &mdash; add it to your cart in one click.</p>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <div class=\\\"col-sm-4 gc-step\\\">\\n                            <span class=\\\"num\\\">2</span>\\n                            <h4>Check out securely</h4>\\n                            <p>Add the recipient&rsquo;s email and a personal note at checkout.</p>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <div class=\\\"col-sm-4 gc-step\\\">\\n                            <span class=\\\"num\\\">3</span>\\n                            <h4>They shop &amp; enjoy</h4>\\n                            <p>The card arrives by email with a code they can use any time.</p>\\n                        </div>\\n                    </section>\\n\\n                    <section class=\\\"gc-faq\\\">\\n                        <h2>Gift card questions, answered</h2>\\n                        <details open>\\n                            <summary>How fast is the gift card delivered?</summary>\\n                            <p>eGift Cards are sent by email, usually within minutes of your order being processed &mdash; which makes them ideal for a last-minute gift. You can also print the email and hand it over in person.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>Does the gift card expire or have fees?</summary>\\n                            <p>No. YogaDirect gift cards never expire and there are no hidden or maintenance fees. The full value stays available until it is used.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>What can it be used on?</summary>\\n                            <p>Any product on YogaDirect.com &mdash; yoga mats, bolsters, blankets, blocks, straps, meditation cushions, clothing, fitness gear and sale items included.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>Can I use more than one gift card, or combine it with a balance?</summary>\\n                            <p>Yes. If an order costs more than the gift card value, the remaining balance can be paid by credit card or PayPal. If the order costs less, the unused value stays on the card for next time.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>Can I send it to someone else&rsquo;s email?</summary>\\n                            <p>Absolutely. Enter the recipient&rsquo;s email address during checkout and we&rsquo;ll deliver the gift card directly to them. Need help? Call <a href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\">800-331-8233</a>.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                    </section>\\n\\n                    <script type=\\\"application/ld+json\\\">\\n                    {\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How fast is the YogaDirect gift card delivered?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"eGift Cards are sent by email, usually within minutes of your order being processed, making them ideal for last-minute gifts. You can also print the email to give in person.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Does the gift card expire or have fees?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"No. YogaDirect gift cards never expire and have no hidden or maintenance fees.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What can a YogaDirect gift card be used on?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Any product on YogaDirect.com including yoga mats, bolsters, blankets, blocks, straps, meditation cushions, clothing, fitness gear and sale items.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Can I combine a gift card with another payment method?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. Any remaining order balance can be paid by credit card or PayPal, and unused gift card value stays on the card for future orders.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Can the gift card be emailed to the recipient?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. Enter the recipient's email address at checkout and the gift card is delivered directly to them.\\\"}}]}\\n                    </script>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"bottom_breadcrumb\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"paging\\\"> \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: PAGING--><!--END: PAGING--> \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: UNDOVIEWALL--><!--END: UNDOVIEWALL--></div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t</section>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--END: ITEMS-->\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: CATEGORY_FOOTER--><!--END: CATEGORY_FOOTER-->\\n\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t</div>\\n    </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n<!--START: PRODUCT_COMPARE--><!--END: PRODUCT_COMPARE-->\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n<!-- Criteo Listing Page Tag -->\\n<script type=\\\"text/javascript\\\">\\nwindow.crto_prodList = window.crto_prodList || [];\\nwindow.crto_category = window.crto_category != 'Gift Cards' ? window.crto_category : '';\\nwindow.crto_keyword = window.crto_keyword != '[keyword]' ? window.crto_keyword : '';\\nvar deviceType = /iPad/.test(navigator.userAgent) ? \\\"t\\\" : /Mobile|iP(hone|od)|Android|BlackBerry|IEMobile|Silk/.test(navigator.userAgent) ? \\\"m\\\" : \\\"d\\\";\\nwindow.criteo_q = window.criteo_q || [];\\nwindow.criteo_q.push(\\n    { event: \\\"setAccount\\\", account: 23464 },\\n    { event: \\\"setSiteType\\\", type: deviceType },\\n    { event: \\\"setEmail\\\", email: \\\"\\\" },\\n    { event: \\\"viewList\\\",\\n        category: window.crto_category,\\n        keywords: window.crto_keyword,\\n        ecpplugin: \\\"3dcart\\\",\\n        item: window.crto_prodList\\n    }\\n);\\n</script>\\n<!-- END Criteo Listing Page Tag -->\\n    <!--/Get current page template-->\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- FOOTER -->\\n    \\n    <footer class=\\\"site-footer lazy\\\">\\n        <div class