rdering the colors and sizes you want now.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>Can I return a sale item?</summary>\\n                            <p>Yes &ndash; sale items follow our standard return policy. Please review the details and instructions on our <a href=\\\"/returns\\\">returns page</a> before sending anything back.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>How much is shipping and how fast will it arrive?</summary>\\n                            <p>Shipping is calculated at checkout based on your address and the items in your cart. Full details on methods and transit times are on our <a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">shipping information page</a>.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>Do I earn rewards points on sale orders?</summary>\\n                            <p>Our <a href=\\\"/rewards-program\\\">rewards program</a> is free to join and lets you earn on your purchases. See the program page for current earning and redemption details.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>Which yoga mat should I choose?</summary>\\n                            <p>For general practice, a classic sticky mat is a great value. For extra grip in hot or sweaty classes, look at our <a href=\\\"/premium-mats\\\">premium</a> and natural rubber mats, and add a <a href=\\\"/towels\\\">mat towel</a>. Still unsure? Call us at <a href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\">800-331-8233</a> and we&rsquo;ll help you pick.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <p class=\\\"yd-help\\\">Questions before you buy? Call <a href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\">800-331-8233</a> or <a href=\\\"/contact-us\\\">send us a message</a> &ndash; real yoga people, happy 