oga-mats\\\" itemprop=\\\"item\\\"><span itemprop=\\\"name\\\">Mats</span></a></li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</ol>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t</section>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--END: BODY_HEADER-->\\n\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<section class=\\\"page_header\\\">\\n                    <h1 class=\\\"page_heading\\\">Yoga Mats</h1>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: CATEGORY_HEADER-->\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"category-header\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"cro-lede\\\">The number one choice for studios, gyms, spas and health clubs since 1998 &mdash; at wholesale prices. Every mat is individually wrapped and arrives unbranded, so you can resell it or hand it straight to your students.</p>\\n<ul class=\\\"cro-points\\\">\\n  <li>Classic to premium thicknesses (1/8\\\" &ndash; 3/8\\\")</li>\\n  <li>Extra long &amp; extra wide sizes</li>\\n  <li>Eco &amp; natural rubber options</li>\\n  <li><a href=\\\"Custom-Printing_c_15.html\\\">Custom print your logo</a></li>\\n</ul>\\n<details class=\\\"cro-more\\\">\\n<summary>More about our yoga mats</summary>\\n<p>Our large selection of yoga mats has been the number one choice for studios, gyms, spas and health clubs since 1998. Each mat is individually wrapped and arrives unbranded, allowing you to resell them to your own customers, or provide them to your students for use in your studio or spa. We promise you'll find the perfect selection of mats to suit your every need.</p>\\n<p>Own a business? Think about customizing your props with your logo! We do <a href=\\\"Custom-Printing_c_15.html\\\">custom printing</a> to allow you to spread your brand message to your students and customers. You have the power to be unique.</p>\\n</details>\\n</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--END: CATEGORY_HEADER--> \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t</section>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<section class=\\\"cro-guide\\\" aria-label=\\\"Shop yoga mats by thickness\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<h2>Not sure which mat? Start here</h2>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"cro-guide-grid\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"yoga-direct-1-8-inch-yoga-mat-24-inch-x-68-inch.html\\\"><span class=\\\"g-t\\\">1/8\\\" &mdash; Light &amp; portable</span><span class=\\\"g-d\\\">Thin, lightweight and easy to roll. Great for travel and studio loaners.</span><span class=\\\"g-l\\\">From $16.99 &rsaquo;</span></a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"yoga-direct-1-4-inch-yoga-mat.html\\\"><span class=\\\"g-t\\\">1/4\\\" &mdash; The all-rounder</span><span class=\\\"g-d\\\">Our classic thickness: grippy, cushioned and suited to every level.</span><span class=\\\"g-l\\\">From $21.99 &rsaquo;</span></a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"yoga-direct-pilates-aero-cushioned-yoga-exercise-mat.html\\\"><span class=\\\"g-t\\\">3/8\\\" &mdash; Extra cushion</span><span class=\\\"g-d\\\">Maximum comfort for sensitive knees, elbows and Pilates work.</span><span class=\\\"g-l\\\">From $29.98 &rsaquo;</span></a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"yoga-direct-extra-wide-yoga-mat-36-inch-x-72-inch-x-1-4-inch.html\\\"><span class=\\\"g-t\\\">Extra long &amp; wide</span><span class=\\\"g-d\\\">Up to 36\\\" x 84\\\" of room for taller and larger bodies.</span><span class=\\\"g-l\\\">From $21.99 &rsaquo;</span></a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"Natural-Rubber-Yoga-Mat-by-Yoga-Direct_p_2511.html\\\"><span class=\\\"g-t\\\">Eco &amp; natural rubber</span><span class=\\\"g-d\\\">Toxin-free materials with outstanding grip for hot, sweaty practice.</span><span class=\\\"g-l\\\">From $29.99 &rsaquo;</span></a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t</section>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: SUB_CATEGORIES_SECTION-->\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<section class=\\\"subcategories_block\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"subcategories\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: SUB_CATEGORIES_FORMAT--><ul class=\\\"columns-4\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"Classic_c_662.html\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: SUB_CATEGORY_IMAGE-->\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"category-img\\\"><img src=\\\"assets/images/SubCatImages/CLASSIC MATS copy.jpg\\\