iews-count\\\">(4)</span>\\n        <!--END: product_review_average-->\\n        <!--END: product_review-->\\n    </div>\\n    \\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"action\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"45mm-Rotary-Yoga-Mat-Cutter_p_1037.html\\\" class=\\\"cro-btn-oos\\\">View Details</a>\\n        <span class=\\\"cro-ship\\\">Shop more <a href=\\\"mat-accessories\\\">mat accessories</a></span>\\n    </div>\\n</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<script class=\\\"slick-cloned\\\" type=\\\"text/javascript\\\">_3d_items_collection[\\\"1037\\\"] = {\\\"id\\\":\\\"Y041ROTCUT45\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"45mm Rotary Yoga Mat Cutter\\\",\\\"price\\\":26.99,\\\"currency\\\":\\\"USD\\\"};</script>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--END: CATEGORY_ITEMS-->\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"bottom_breadcrumb\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"paging\\\"> \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: PAGING--><!--END: PAGING--> \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: UNDOVIEWALL--><!--END: UNDOVIEWALL--></div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"cro-news\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"cro-news-copy\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<h3>Deals before everyone else</h3>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Join the YogaDirect email list for new arrivals, seasonal sales and studio-only offers.</p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<form class=\\\"cro-news-form\\\" action=\\\"mailinglist_subscribe.asp\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<input type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"action\\\" value=\\\"subscribe\\\" />\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<label class=\\\"cro-sr\\\" for=\\\"cro-news-email\\\">Email address</label>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<input type=\\\"email\\\" id=\\\"cro-news-email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"your@email.com\\\" required />\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"cro-btn\\\">Sign Me Up</button>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"cro-news-fine\\\">No spam &mdash; unsubscribe anytime.</p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</form>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t</section>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--END: ITEMS-->\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<section class=\\\"cro-faq\\\" aria-label=\\\"Yoga mat buying questions\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<h2>Yoga mat questions, answered</h2>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<details>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<summary>Which thickness should I choose?</summary>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>1/8\\\" mats are thin, light and easy to carry &mdash; great for travel and studio loaners. 1/4\\\" is our most versatile all-purpose thickness with grip and cushion for every level. 3/8\\\" gives the most cushion for sensitive knees, elbows and Pilates work.</p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</details>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<details>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<summary>I'm tall or prefer more room &mdash; what fits?</summary>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Choose an extra long (24\\\" x 84\\\"), extra wide (36\\\" x 72\\\") or extra long and wide (36\\\" x 84\\\") mat. All are offered in our classic 1/4\\\" thickness.</p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</details>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<details>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<summary>Do you offer discounts for studios and bulk orders?</summary>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Yes. Mats arrive individually wrapped and unbranded, and <a href=\\\"/quantity-discount-yoga-gear\\\">quantity pricing</a> applies as your order grows. Call <a href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\">800-331-8233</a> or <a href=\\\"/contact-us\\\">contact us</a> for a studio quote.</p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</details>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<details>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<summary>Can I add my studio logo to the mats?</summary>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Absolutely &mdash; see our <a href=\\\"/custom-printing\\\">custom printing</a> options to put your brand on mats and props.</p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</details>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<details>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<summary>How do I clean and care for my mat?</summary>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Wipe your mat down after practice with a dedicated mat spray such as our <a href=\\\"everom4ozyogamatcleaner\\\">EverOM Yoga Mat Cleaner</a>, then let it air dry flat or rolled loosely out of direct sunlight.</p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</details>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<details>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<summary>What are your shipping and return policies?</summary>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Full details are on our <a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">shipping info</a> and <a href=\\\"/returns\\\">returns</a> pages, and our team is happy to help before you order.</p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</details>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t</section>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: CATEGORY_FOOTER-->\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"category-footer\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<h2>Selecting Yoga Mats</h2>\\n<h3>With so many choices, here's what to know before you buy</h3>\\n<br>\\n<p>Whether you are a first-time student or a longtime teacher, you'll find your ideal yoga mat thanks to our fantastic variety at bargain prices. All of our mats are designed to effectively support your poses, with just the right amount of tackiness, cushion and comfort.</p>\\n<br>\\n<p>If you're new to this ancient practice and unsure how devoted you'll be to downward dog a month from now, consider  Classic Yoga Mats. They are a popular and affordable choice among yogis at every level - a great value for the budget-conscious novice. If you're an instructor, these discount yoga mats are a low-cost way to stock your studio.</p>\\n<br>\\n<p>Advanced yogis or those with sensitive elbows and knees will appreciate the added comfort of our quarter-inch extra thick yoga mats. Yoga Direct carries more than a half-dozen varieties, with extra-long lengths and/or extra-wide widths to accommodate people of all heights and sizes. Even children have <a href=\\\"Yoga-Mats-for-Kids_c_70.html\\\">specialized yoga mats</a> to choose from.&nbsp;</p>\\n<br>\\n<p><a href=\\\"yoga-direct-premium-printed-1-4-inch-alignment-yoga-mat.html\\\">Alignment Yoga Mats</a> benefit both new and advanced yogis. Whether you're practicing at home or the teacher's too busy to correct your posture in class, you can trust the printed lines on these mats to help position your hands and feet properly.</p>\\n<br>\\n<p>Our big selection of discount yoga mats includes an option for everyone. For something different from the norm, check out the <a href=\\\"Blankets-and-Towels_c_10.html\\\">Mexican blanket</a>; the eco-friendly alternative that's free of toxins; and the relaxing, <a href=\\\"yoga-direct-1-4-inch-yoga-mat-scented.html\\\">lavender-scented mat</a> that will lull you into serenity. </p>\\n<br>\\n<p>We guarantee you'll find the perfect fit at an excellent price. Yoga Mats are the basis of your practice. They ground you to the earth and your space like nothing else. Invest in your ground. You will be glad you did. </p>  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--END: CATEGORY_FOOTER-->\\n\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t</div>\\n    </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<script type=\\\"application/ld+json\\\">{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Which yoga mat thickness should I choose?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"1/8 inch mats are thin, light and easy to carry, great for travel and studio loaners. 1/4 inch is the most versatile all-purpose thickness with grip and cushion for every level. 3/8 inch gives the most cushion for sensitive knees, elbows and Pilates work.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What sizes do you offer for taller yogis?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Choose an extra long 24 x 84 inch, extra wide 36 x 72 inch, or extra long and wide 36 x 84 inch mat, all in the classic 1/4 inch thickness.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Do you offer discounts for studios and bulk orders?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. Mats arrive individually wrapped and unbranded, and quantity pricing applies as your order grows. Call 800-331-8233 or contact us for a studio quote.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Can I add my studio logo to the mats?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes, custom printing is available so you can put your brand on mats and props.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How do I clean and care for my yoga mat?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Wipe the mat down after practice with a dedicated mat cleaner, then air dry it flat or loosely rolled out of direct sunlight.\\\"}}]}</script>\\n\\n\\n\\n<!--START: PRODUCT_COMPARE--><!--END: PRODUCT_COMPARE-->\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n<!-- Criteo Listing Page Tag -->\\n<script type=\\\"text/javascript\\\">\\nwindow.crto_prodList = window.crto_prodList || [];\\nwindow.crto_category = window.crto_category != 'Mats' ? window.crto_category : '';\\nwindow.crto_keyword = window.crto_keyword != '[keyword]' ? window.crto_keyword : '';\\nvar deviceType = /iPad/.test(navigator.userAgent) ? \\\"t\\\" : /Mobile|iP(hone|od)|Android|BlackBerry|IEMobile|Silk/.test(navigator.userAgent) ? \\\"m\\\" : \\\"d\\\";\\nwindow.criteo_q = window.criteo_q || [];\\nwindow.criteo_q.push(\\n    { event: \\\"setAccount\\\", account: 23464 },\\n    { event: \\\"setSiteType\\\", type: deviceType },\\n    { event: \\\"setEmail\\\", email: \\\"\\\" },\\n    { event: \\\"viewList\\\",\\n        category: window.crto_category,\\n        keywords: window.crto_keyword,\\n        ecpplugin: \\\"3dcart\\\",\\n        item: window.crto_prodList\\n    }\\n);\\n</script>\\n<!-- END Criteo Listing Page Tag -->\\n    <!--/Get current page template-->\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- FOOTER -->\\n    \\n    <footer class=\\\"site-footer lazy\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"col-xs-12\\\">\\n                  &nbsp;\\n                    <!--START: FRAME_MAILLIST--><!--E