C required.</span></li>\\n                            <li><i class=\\\"la la-truck\\\"></i><span><strong>Free shipping at $99</strong> &mdash; add a block, strap or mat bag to qualify.</span></li>\\n                        </ul>\\n                        <div class=\\\"cro-help\\\">\\n                            <strong>Not sure which premium mat is right for you?</strong>\\n                            We have been outfitting yogis and studios for years &mdash; call <a href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\">800-331-8233</a> or <a href=\\\"/contact-us\\\">send us a message</a> and we will match you to the right mat in a couple of minutes. Buying 5 or more? Ask about <a href=\\\"/quantity-discount-yoga-gear\\\">quantity pricing</a>.\\n                        </div>\\n                    </div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t</section>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: SUB_CATEGORIES_SECTION--><!--END: SUB_CATEGORIES_SECTION-->\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: FEATURE_MENU--><!--END: FEATURE_MENU-->\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: ITEMS-->\\n        <script>\\n            window.crto_prodList = window.crto_prodList || [];\\n            window.crto_prodList.push(\\\"[catalogid]\\\");\\n            window.crto_category = \\\"Premium\\\";\\n            window.crto_keyword = \\\"[keyword]\\\";\\n        </script>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<section class=\\\"category-products clearfix\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<form action=\\\"view_category.asp?cat=575\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" name=\\\"frmsortby\\\" id=\\\"frmsortby\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"row category-toolbar\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"col-sm-6 clearfix\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: category_view_switch--><!--END: category_view_switch-->\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<h2 class=\\\"titles\\\">Shop Premium Mats [4] &mdash; all in stock</h2>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"col-sm-6\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: sortbylist-->\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"sort-by\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\