\\"></i> In stock &amp; ready to ship</span>\\n    </div>\\n\\t<!--END: addtocart-->\\n</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<script class=\\\"slick-cloned\\\" type=\\\"text/javascript\\\">_3d_items_collection[\\\"156\\\"] = {\\\"id\\\":\\\"YP41MATXXXSQ\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Gaia Eco Yoga Mat by Yoga Direct\\\",\\\"price\\\":34.98,\\\"currency\\\":\\\"USD\\\"};</script>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--END: CATEGORY_ITEMS-->\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"bottom_breadcrumb\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"paging\\\"> \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: PAGING--><!--END: PAGING--> \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: UNDOVIEWALL--><!--END: UNDOVIEWALL--></div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\n                    <!-- START: cross-sell + value panels -->\\n                    <div class=\\\"row yd-panels\\\">\\n                        <div class=\\\"col-sm-6\\\">\\n                            <div class=\\\"yd-panel\\\">\\n                                <h3>Buying For A Studio Or Class?</h3>\\n                                <p>Save more when you buy multiples. Quantity discounts are applied automatically on mats, blocks, straps and more &mdash; no account or negotiation needed.</p>\\n                                <a class=\\\"yd-btn\\\" href=\\\"/quantity-discount-yoga-gear\\\">See Quantity Pricing</a>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <div class=\\\"col-sm-6\\\">\\n                            <div class=\\\"yd-panel\\\">\\n                                <h3>Complete The Set &amp; Save</h3>\\n                                <p>Pair your mat with a strap, blocks and a carry bag in a ready-made kit &mdash; bundled pricing beats buying pieces separately.</p>\\n                                <a class=\\\"yd-btn yd-btn-alt\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-kits\\\">Shop Yoga Kits &amp; Bundles</a>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div class=\\\"yd-help\\\">\\n                        <strong>Not sure which mat is right for you?</strong> Our team practices on this gear every day. Call <a href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\">800-331-8233</a> or <a href=\\\"/contact-us\\\">send us a message</a> &mdash; we'll help you pick in minutes.\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div class=\\\"yd-faq\\\">\\n                        <h2>Specialty Yoga Mat FAQs</h2>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>Which thickness should I choose?</summary>\\n                            <p>Standard mats (about 1/8\\\") give you the most stability for standing and balance poses. Thicker cushioned mats (1/4\\\" to 3/8\\\") are ideal if you have sensitive knees, wrists or a back, or for Pilates, floor work and restorative practice.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>Are these mats good for kids?</summary>\\n                            <p>Yes &mdash; our printed and character mats are sized and cushioned for younger practitioners. You can browse even more options in our <a href=\\\"Kids-Yoga-Mats_c_637.html\\\">Kids' Yoga Mats</a> collection.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>How much is shipping?</summary>\\n                            <p>Orders of $99 or more ship free within the contiguous U.S. Smaller orders ship at a flat, calculated rate shown in your cart before you pay. Full details are on our <a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">shipping page</a>.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>What if the mat isn't right for me?</summary>\\n                            <p>We keep returns simple. Review the timeframes and steps on our <a href=\\\"/returns\\\">returns page</a>, or contact us and we'll walk you through it.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>Can I add a custom logo or print?</summary>\\n                            <p>Yes. We print mats, towels and bags for studios, events and corporate gifts. Learn more about <a href=\\\"/custom-printing\\\">custom printing</a>.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div class=\\\"yd-seo-copy\\\">\\n                        <h2>About Our Specialty Yoga Mats</h2>\\n                        <p>Specialty mats are the ones that do a specific job better: extra-thick cushioning for joint support, playful prints that get kids excited to move, and eco-conscious materials for practitioners who care about what's under their feet. Every mat we sell is chosen by people who teach and practice, priced low every day, and stocked in our own warehouse so it ships quickly. If you want a more traditional option, compare our <a href=\\\"Classic_c_662.html\\\">classic</a> and <a href=\\\"premium-mats\\\">premium</a> mats, or see <a href=\\\"all-yoga-mats\\\">all yoga mats</a>.</p>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <!-- END: cross-sell + value panels -->\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t</section>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--END: ITEMS-->\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: CATEGORY_FOOTER--><!--END: CATEGORY_FOOTER-->\\n\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t</div>\\n    </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<script type=\\\"application/ld+json\\\">\\n{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Which yoga mat thickness should I choose?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Standard mats around 1/8 inch give the most stability for standing and balance poses. Thicker cushioned mats from 1/4 to 3/8 inch are better for sensitive knees, wrists or back, and for Pilates, floor work and restorative practice.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Are specialty mats good for kids?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. Printed and character mats are sized and cushioned for younger practitioners, and additional options are available in the Kids Yoga Mats collection.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How much does shipping cost?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Orders of $99 or more ship free within the contiguous U.S. Smaller orders ship at a calculated rate shown in the cart before checkout.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Can I get a custom printed yoga mat?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. YogaDirect offers custom printing on mats, towels and bags for studios, events and corporate gifts.\\\"}}]}\\n</script>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n<!--START: PRODUCT_COMPARE--><!--END: PRODUCT_COMPARE-->\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n<!-- Criteo Listing Page Tag -->\\n<script type=\\\"text/javascript\\\">\\nwindow.crto_prodList = window.crto_prodList || [];\\nwindow.crto_category = window.crto_category != 'Specialty Yoga Mats' ? window.crto_category : '';\\nwindow.crto_keyword = window.crto_keyword != '[keyword]' ? window.crto_keyword : '';\\nvar deviceType = /iPad/.test(navigator.userAgent) ? \\\"t\\\" : /Mobile|iP(hone|od)|Android|BlackBerry|IEMobile|Silk/.test(navigator.userAgent) ? \\\"m\\\" : \\\"d\\\";\\nwindow.criteo_q = window.criteo_q || [];\\nwindow.criteo_q.push(\\n    { event: \\\"setAccount\\\", account: 23464 },\\n    { event: \\\"setSiteType\\\", type: deviceType },\\n    { event: \\\"setEmail\\\", email: \\\"\\\" },\\n    { event: \\\"viewList\\\",\\n        category: window.crto_category,\\n        keywords: window.crto_keyword,\\n        ecpplugin: \\\"3dcart\\\",\\n        item: window.crto_prodList\\n    }\\n);\\n</script>\\n<!-- END Criteo Listing Page Tag -->\\n    <!--/Get current page template--