fer\\\",\\\"price\\\":\\\"7.99\\\",\\\"priceCurrency\\\":\\\"USD\\\",\\\"availability\\\":\\\"https://schema.org/InStock\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.yogadirect.com/ninja-turtles-leonardo-yoga-mat-modern\\\"}}}]}</script>\\n\\n                    <aside class=\\\"yd-bulk\\\">\\n                        <h3>Teaching a kids' class or outfitting a studio?</h3>\\n                        <p>Buy more and save more with our quantity pricing on mats and props &mdash; ideal for schools, camps, gyms and kids' yoga programs. Need a custom logo on your mats? We do that too.</p>\\n                        <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/quantity-discount-yoga-gear\\\">See Quantity Pricing</a>\\n                        <a class=\\\"btn btn-default\\\" href=\\\"/custom-printing\\\">Custom Printing</a>\\n                        <span class=\\\"yd-callnote\\\">Prefer to talk it through? Call <a href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\">800-331-8233</a> or <a href=\\\"/contact-us\\\">request a quote</a>.</span>\\n                    </aside>\\n\\n                    <div class=\\\"yd-cat-intro\\\">\\n                        <h2 style=\\\"font-size:20px;margin:0 0 10px;\\\">Why kids practice better on their own mat</h2>\\n                        <p>Yoga can be fun, healthy and educational for kids &mdash; so why not give them a mat designed just for them? Whether plain or branded, our kids' mats are sized just right for children through pre-teens, so poses feel steady instead of slippery and the mat is light enough for little hands to roll up and carry.</p>\\n                        <ul class=\\\"yd-bullets\\\">\\n                            <li>Kid-friendly sizing &mdash; less mat to manage than a full adult mat</li>\\n                            <li>Cushioned, textured surface for balance poses and tumbling</li>\\n                            <li>Fun colors and characters that keep kids excited to practice</li>\\n                            <li>Wipe-clean surface for classrooms, studios and living-room practice</li>\\n                        </ul>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div class=\\\"yd-crosssell\\\">\\n                        <h3>Complete their practice (and save on shipping)</h3>\\n                        <ul>\\n                            <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-kits\\\">Yoga Kits &amp; Bundles</a></li>\\n                            <li><a href=\\\"/mat-bags\\\">Mat Bags &amp; Slings</a></li>\\n                            <li><a href=\\\"/blocks-wedges\\\">Blocks &amp; Wedges</a></li>\\n                            <li><a href=\\\"/straps-sandbags\\\">Straps</a></li>\\n                            <li><a href=\\\"/towels\\\">Yoga Towels</a></li>\\n                            <li><a href=\\\"/Kids_c_649.html\\\">Kids' Fitness Gear</a></li>\\n                            <li><a href=\\\"/all-yoga-mats\\\">All Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n                            <li><a href=\\\"/Gift-Cards_c_645.html\\\">Gift Cards</a></li>\\n                        </ul>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div class=\\\"yd-faq\\\">\\n                        <h2>Kids' yoga mat questions, answered</h2>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>What size mat is best for a child?</summary>\\n                            <p>Our kids' mats are sized for children through pre-teens, so there is less mat to slide around on and it's easier for them to carry. Taller pre-teens who are growing fast often do well on a standard adult mat &mdash; see our <a href=\\\"/all-yoga-mats\\\">full mat selection</a> or call <a href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\">800-331-8233</a> and we'll help you choose.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>How do I clean a kids' yoga mat?</summary>\\n                            <p>Wipe the mat down with a damp cloth and a mild soap or mat spray, then let it air dry flat or rolled loosely. Avoid harsh solvents and direct sun for long periods.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>Do you offer discounts for schools, camps and studios?</summary>\\n                            <p>Yes &mdash; the more you buy, the more you save. See our <a href=\\\"/quantity-discount-yoga-gear\\\">quantity pricing</a> page, or <a href=\\\"/contact-us\\\">contact us</a> for a bulk quote and custom-printed mats.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>What are the shipping and return policies?</summary>\\n                            <p>Full details are on our <a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">shipping information</a> and <a href=\\\"/returns\\\">returns</a> pages. If anything isn't right, our US-based team is here to help at <a href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\">800-331-8233</a>.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>Can I earn rewards on this order?</summary>\\n                            <p>Yes. Join our free <a href=\\\"/rewards-program\\\">Rewards Program</a> and earn points toward future savings every time you shop.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n<script type=\\\"application/ld+json\\\">{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What size mat is best for a child?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Our kids' yoga mats are sized for children through pre-teens, so there is less mat to slide around on and it is easier for them to carry. Taller pre-teens often do well on a standard adult mat.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How do I clean a kids' yoga mat?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Wipe the mat down with a damp cloth and a mild soap or mat spray, then let it air dry flat or rolled loosely. Avoid harsh solvents and prolonged direct sun.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Do you offer discounts for schools, camps and studios?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. Quantity pricing is available on mats and props, and custom printing is available for studios and programs. Contact us for a bulk quote.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What are the shipping and return policies?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Full shipping and return details are available on our shipping information and returns pages, or call 800-331-8233.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Can I earn rewards on this order?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. Join the free YogaDirect Rewards Program and earn points toward future savings on every order.\\\"}}]}</script>\\n\\n                    <div class=\\\"yd-help\\\">\\n                        <strong>Not sure which mat to pick?</strong> Our yoga specialists help parents, teachers and studios every day. Call <a href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\">800-331-8233</a> or <a href=\\\"/contact-us\\\">send us a message</a> &mdash; we'll point you to the right mat.\\n                    </div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"bottom_breadcrumb\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"paging\\\"> \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: PAGING--><!--END: PAGING--> \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: UNDOVIEWALL--><!--END: UNDOVIEWALL--></div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t</section>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--END: ITEMS-->\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: CATEGORY_FOOTER--><!--END: CATEGORY_FOOTER-->\\n\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t</div>\\n    </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n<!--START: PRODUCT_COMPARE--><!--END: PRODUCT_COMPARE-->\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n<!-- Criteo Listing Page Tag -->\\n<script type=\\\"text