 on your mat: its rolled diameter and its length. Standard 1/4&quot; (6mm) mats fit all of the bags on this page. If you use an extra-thick, extra-long or extra-wide mat, choose the Oversized Nylon Drawstring Bag for the roomiest fit. Exact dimensions are listed on each product page.</p>\\n                    </details>\\n                    <details>\\n                        <summary>Zipper, drawstring or strap - what&rsquo;s the difference?</summary>\\n                        <p>A full zipper makes it easiest to slide your mat in and out and protects it from dust. A drawstring closure is lighter and fits bulkier mats. A simple <a href=\\\"/straps-sandbags\\\">mat strap or sling</a> is the lightest, lowest-cost option if you don&rsquo;t need storage or protection.</p>\\n                    </details>\\n                    <details>\\n                        <summary>Can I carry water bottles, keys or a phone?</summary>\\n                        <p>Yes - the zippered and embroidered bags include a pocket sized for essentials like keys, a phone or a wallet, so you can head to class without a second bag.</p>\\n                    </details>\\n                    <details>\\n                        <summary>How fast will my order ship?</summary>\\n                        <p>Every bag on this page is in stock and ships from our warehouse on business days. See <a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">shipping information</a> for delivery estimates and rates, and note that orders over $99 ship free.</p>\\n                    </details>\\n                    <details>\\n                        <summary>What if it doesn&rsquo;t fit my mat?</summary>\\n                        <p>Send it back. Review our simple <a href=\\\"/returns\\\">return policy</a>, or call <a href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\">800-331-8233</a> before you order and we&rsquo;ll help you pick the right size the first time.</p>\\n                    </details>\\n                </section>\\n                <!-- END: sizing FAQ -->\\n\\n                <div class=\\\"yd-guarantee\\\">\\n                    <strong>Shop with confidence:</strong> secure checkout &middot; <a href=\\\"/returns\\\">hassle-free returns</a> &middot; real humans at <a href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\">800-331-8233</a> &middot; earn points with our <a href=\\\"/rewards-program\\\">Rewards Program</a>\\n                </div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: CATEGORY_FOOTER--><!--END: CATEGORY_FOOTER-->\\n\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t</div>\\n    </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<script type=\\\"application/ld+json\\\">{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ItemList\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Yoga Mat Bags & Carriers\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Large Zippered Yoga Mat Bag\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.yogadirect.com/zippered-yoga-mat-bag.html\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Oversized Nylon Drawstring Yoga Mat Bag\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.yogadirect.com/Oversized-Nylon-Drawstring-Yoga-Mat-Bag_p_1245.html\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Embroidered Yoga Mat Bag\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.yogadirect.com/Embroidered-Yoga-Mat-Bag_p_1506.html\\\"}]}</script>\\n<script type=\\\"application/ld+json\\\">{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Which yoga mat bag size do I need?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Standard 1/4 inch (6mm) mats fit all of the bags in this category. For extra-thick, extra-long or extra-wide mats, choose the Oversized Nylon Drawstring Yoga Mat Bag. Exact dimensions are listed on each product page.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What is the difference between a zippered bag, a drawstring bag and a mat strap?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"A full zipper makes it easiest to load your mat and protects it from dust. A drawstring closure is lighter and fits bulkier mats. A mat strap or sling is the lightest, lowest-cost way to carry a mat when you do not need storage.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Do yoga mat bags have a pocket for keys and a phone?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. The zippered and embroidered mat bags include a pocket sized for essentials such as keys, a phone or a wallet.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How fast do yoga mat bags ship?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"All mat bags shown are in stock and ship on business days from our warehouse. Orders over $99 ship free; see our shipping page for rates and delivery estimates.\\\"}}]}</script>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n<!--START: PRODUCT_COMPARE--><!--END: PRODUCT_COMPARE-->\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n<!-- Criteo Listing Page Tag -->\\n<script type=\\\"text/javascript\\\">\\nwindow.crto_prodList = window.crto_prodList || [];\\nwindow.crto_category = window.crto_category != 'Bags' ? window.crto_category : '';\\nwindow.crto_keyword = window.crto_keyword != '[keyword]' ? window.crto_keyword : '';\\nvar deviceType = /iPad/.test(navigator.userAgent) ? \\\"t\\\" : /Mobile|iP(hone|od)|Android|BlackBerry|IEMobile|Silk/.test(navigator.userAgent) ? \\\"m\\\" : \\\"d\\\";\\nwindow.criteo_q = window.criteo_q || [];\\nwindow.criteo_q.push(\\n    { event: \\\"setAccount\\\", account: 23464 },\\n    { event: \\\"setSiteType\\\", type: deviceType },\\n    { event: \\\"setEmail\\\", email: \\\"\\\" },\\n    { event: \\\"viewList\\\",\\n        category: window.crto_category,\\n        keywords: window.crto_keyword,\\n        ecpplugin: \\\"3dcart\\\",\\n        item: window.crto_prodList\\n    }\\n);\\n</script>\\n<!-- END Criteo Listing Page Tag -->\\n    <!--/Get current page template-->\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- FOOTER 