/a>\\n                        <a href=\\\"yogadirectyogamattowel\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-default\\\">Add Mat Towel &ndash; $10.79</a>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <!-- END: CRO mat care kit cross-sell -->\\n\\n                    <!-- START: CRO related categories -->\\n                    <div class=\\\"cro-xsell\\\">\\n                        <h2>Shoppers also browse</h2>\\n                        <div class=\\\"cro-xsell-grid\\\">\\n                            <a href=\\\"/mat-bags\\\">Mat Bags &amp; Slings<small>Carry &amp; protect your mat</small></a>\\n                            <a href=\\\"/all-yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats<small>Classic to premium</small></a>\\n                            <a href=\\\"/towels\\\">Yoga Towels<small>Hand &amp; mat sizes</small></a>\\n                            <a href=\\\"/yoga-kits\\\">Yoga Kits<small>Bundle &amp; save</small></a>\\n                            <a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale Items<small>Up to 50% off</small></a>\\n                        </div>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <!-- END: CRO related categories -->\\n\\n                    <!-- START: CRO FAQ -->\\n                    <div class=\\\"cro-faq\\\">\\n                        <h2>Yoga mat cleaning questions, answered</h2>\\n                        <details open>\\n                            <summary>How often should I clean my yoga mat?</summary>\\n                            <p>Give your mat a light spray and wipe after every practice &mdash; it takes under a minute and removes the sweat and oils that make mats slippery. A deeper clean once or twice a month keeps the surface fresh and odor-free.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>Will a mat cleaner damage my mat?</summary>\\n                            <p>Our mat spray is formulated to be gentle on common mat materials such as PVC, TPE, rubber and cork. Avoid harsh household cleaners and bleach, which can break down the surface and reduce grip over time.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>Mat towel or mat spray &mdash; which do I need?</summary>\\n                            <p>Use the spray to clean and refresh your mat; use a mat towel on top of your mat during sweaty or hot yoga classes for extra grip and easy machine washing. Many practitioners use both.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>How fast will my order ship, and can I return it?</summary>\\n                            <p>Both items are in stock and ship quickly from our warehouse. See our <a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">shipping information</a> for delivery options and our <a href=\\\"/returns\\\">returns page</a> for our easy return policy.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <!-- END: CRO FAQ -->\\n\\n                    <!-- START: CRO help block -->\\n                    <div class=\\\"cro-help\\\">\\n                        <h2>Not sure which mat accessory is right for you?</h2>\\n                        <p>Our team practices yoga too &mdash; we&rsquo;re happy to help you choose.</p>\\n                        <a class=\\\"cro-help-link\\\" href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\">Call 800-331-8233</a>\\n                        <a class=\\\"cro-help-link\\\" href=\\\"/contact-us\\\">Message Us</a>\\n                        <a class=\\\"cro-help-link\\\" href=\\\"/faqs\\\">Read FAQs</a>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <!-- END: CRO help block -->\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"bottom_breadcrumb\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"paging\\\"> \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: PAGING--><!--END: PAGING--> \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--START: UNDOVIEWALL--><!--END: UNDOVIEWALL--></div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t</section>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<!--END: ITEMS-->\\