ze:13px\\\">Or call <a href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\" style=\\\"color:#fff;text-decoration:underline\\\">800-331-8233</a> &mdash; we&rsquo;ve been supplying studios for years.</p>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div class=\\\"yd-guide\\\" id=\\\"blanket-guide\\\">\\n                        <h2>Which yoga blanket is right for you?</h2>\\n                        <ul>\\n                            <li><strong>Best value / first blanket:</strong> <a href=\\\"handmade-traditional-mexican-yoga-blanket\\\">Handmade Traditional Mexican Yoga Blanket</a> &ndash; the classic studio standard at our lowest price ($19.99).</li>\\n                            <li><strong>Highest rated by customers:</strong> <a href=\\\"Handmade-Deluxe-Mexican-Yoga-Blanket_p_1563.html\\\">Handmade Deluxe Mexican Yoga Blanket</a> &ndash; 5 stars from 6 reviewers, with a heavier weave that keeps its shape when folded.</li>\\n                            <li><strong>Restorative &amp; prop stacking:</strong> heavier options like the <a href=\\\"Thunderbird-Mexican-Yoga-Blanket_p_2543.html\\\">Thunderbird</a> give firmer, more stable folds under hips, knees and shoulders.</li>\\n                            <li><strong>Matching studio sets:</strong> <a href=\\\"Solid-Color-Mexican-Yoga-Blanket_p_2541.html\\\">Solid Color Mexican Yoga Blankets</a> in coordinated colors keep your space looking consistent.</li>\\n                            <li><strong>Newest patterns:</strong> <a href=\\\"New-Striped-Traditional-Mexican-Yoga-Blanket_p_2542.html\\\">New Striped Traditional Mexican Yoga Blanket</a>.</li>\\n                        </ul>\\n                        <p style=\\\"margin:12px 0 0;font-size:14px\\\">Still deciding? <a href=\\\"/contact-us\\\">Message our team</a> or call <a href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\">800-331-8233</a> &mdash; we&rsquo;ll match a blanket to your practice.</p>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div class=\\\"yd-crosssell\\\">\\n                        <h2>Complete your practice</h2>\\n                        <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n                            <div class=\\\"col-xs-6 col-sm-3\\\"><a href=\\\"/bolsters\\\">Bolsters<small>Deep restorative support</small></a></div>\\n                            <div class=\\\"col-xs-6 col-sm-3\\\"><a href=\\\"/blocks-wedges\\\">Blocks &amp; Wedges<small>Alignment essentials</small></a></div>\\n                            <div class=\\\"col-xs-6 col-sm-3\\\"><a href=\\\"/straps-sandbags\\\">Straps<small>Extend your reach</small></a></div>\\n                            <div class=\\\"col-xs-6 col-sm-3\\\"><a href=\\\"/yoga-kits\\\">Yoga Kits<small>Bundle &amp; save</small></a></div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <p style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#666;margin:0\\\">Tip: add a bolster or block set and you may reach the <strong>$99 free shipping</strong> threshold.</p>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div class=\\\"yd-faq\\\">\\n                        <h2>Yoga blanket FAQs</h2>\\n                        <details open>\\n                            <summary>How do I use a yoga blanket?</summary>\\n                            <p>Fold it into a firm rectangle to sit on for meditation and seated forward folds, roll it to support knees or ankles, slide it under shoulders in shoulderstand, stack two or three for restorative shapes, or drape it over you for warmth in savasana.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>Are these blankets machine washable?</summary>\\n                            <p>Yes. We recommend washing in cold water on a gentle cycle and tumble drying on low or line drying to protect the woven fibers and colors. Specific care details are listed on each product page.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>What size are the blankets?</summary>\\n                            <p>Our Mexican-style yoga blankets are sized for both prop work and full-body coverage. Exact dimensions and weight vary by style, so check the specifications on the individual product page before you order.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>Which blanket is best for restorative yoga?</summary>\\n                            <p>Choose a heavier weave, such as the Deluxe or Thunderbird styles. The extra weight and density hold a crisper fold, so props stay stable under hips, knees and shoulders during long holds.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>Do you offer discounts for studios buying multiple blankets?</summary>\\n                            <p>Yes &mdash; quantity pricing applies as you increase your order quantity. See our <a href=\\\"/quantity-discount-yoga-gear\\\">quantity pricing page</a> for details, or contact us for large studio orders.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                        <details>\\n                            <summary>What about shipping and returns?</summary>\\n                            <p>Orders over $99 qualify for free shipping &mdash; see <a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping Info</a> for delivery options and timeframes, and our <a href=\\\"/returns\\\">Returns page</a> for the full return policy.</p>\\n                        </details>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div class=\\\"yd-rewards\\\">\\n                        <strong>Earn points every time you shop</strong>\\n                        Join Yoga Direct Rewards free and turn this order into savings on your next one. <a href=\\\"/rewards-program\\\">See how rewards work &rarr;</a>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <p class=\\\"yd-help\\\">Questions before you buy? Call <a href=\\\"tel:800-331-8233\\\">800-331-8233</a>, <a href=\\\"/co